&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;$ brew install libfido2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description></item><item><title>Articles</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2026/20260513-articles/</link><pubDate>Wed, 13 May 2026 11:15:33 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/zh-tw/posts/2026/20260513-articles/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
