&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/warp-tech/warpgate" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;warpgate: is a smart &amp;amp; fully transparent SSH, HTTPS, Kubernetes, MySQL, PostgreSQL bastion host that doesn&amp;rsquo;t require a client app or an SSH wrapper.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
